                            # For now we can allow any value for column X within bounds, but must be consistent with future constraints. To keep DP finite, we need to consider all possibilities for column X as well.
                            # However column X will be paired with column X-1 in next iteration (as part of pair (X-1, X)). So we need to assign a value for column X now.
