Since \(M=2001 = 2\cdot1001-1\), the interval \(1\le m\le 2001\) contains two full
periods except the final residue 0. Hence the total number of qualified
serial numbers is  

\[
\boxed{2\;Q}=2\times 90 = 180 .
\]

