### 3.  Solving the recurrence

The characteristic equation \(x^{2}=2x+1\) has roots \(1\pm\sqrt2\).
Hence

\[
S_n = \frac{(1+\sqrt2)^{\,n+1}+(1-\sqrt2)^{\,n+1}}{2}.
\]

