\[
\sum_{c\in C}(\Delta-d(c))=2048\Delta-\sum_{c\in C}d(c)
                      =2048\Delta-\sum_{r\in R}d(r)
                      =23\Delta .
\]

The 23 dummy rows can accommodate precisely \(23\Delta\) edges, so the
completion is possible.  
Thus we obtain a **\(\Delta\)-regular bipartite graph** \(G^{*}\) on the
