### 4.  Final answer  

The largest constant \(C\) for which  

\[
\bigl(x_1+\dots +x_6\bigr)^{3}
\;\ge\;
C\;\gcd(x_1,\dots ,x_6)\;
\sum_{i=1}^{6}\bigl(\gcd(x_i,x_{i+1})\,
\operatorname{lcm}(x_{i+1},x_{i+2})\bigr)
\]

holds for **all** positive integers \(x_1,\dots ,x_6\) is  

\[
\boxed{\,C=8\,}.
\]

