                                # interior cells: all cells within rectangle
                                # outside ring cells: cells not in S that share a vertex with any cell in S
                                # compute min interior value, max outside ring value
                                min_inside = min(grid[i][j] for i in range(r1,r2+1) for j in range(c1,c2+1))
