\[
N_{\text{win}} = \frac12\,N_{\text{total}}.
\]

Hence  

\[
p = \frac{N_{\text{win}}}{N_{\text{total}}}= \frac12,
\qquad
\frac{m}{n}= \frac12,
\]

with \(\gcd(m,n)=1\). Therefore  

\[
\boxed{m=1}.
\]

